  characterName: Voodoo
  description: 'Voodoo is Neo Melbourne''s most recognisable rider, not because she
    wants the attention, but because she''s always at the front and she''s always
    angry about something. The tattoos covering her body aren''t decorative; they''re
    a record of every bad decision she''s survived. An orphan left to the fate of
    forever wandering the brutal streets that raised her, she now races through them
    through the night. '
